## BudgetBrain Android Local Properties Configuration Template
## Copy this file to local.properties and customize for your environment.
## DO NOT commit actual secrets or credentials to source control.

## Android SDK Location (Auto-generated by Android Studio)
# sdk.dir=C:\\Users\\<username>\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk

## Environment Driven API Base URL (Defaults to Render Production Backend)
# BUDGETBRAIN_API_BASE_URL=https://budgetbrain-ojnr.onrender.com/api/v1/

## Google OAuth Web Client ID (From Google Cloud Console)
# GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

## Feature Flags
# ENABLE_BIOMETRIC_LOCK=true
